"Any NDEF tag can be the coin: a transit card, a hotel key, a blank. The app keeps a hash of the tag, never its contents. A copied tag is the same coin — the factor is possession, like every physical key ever cut. One honesty: NFC reading needs the NFC Tag Reading capability, which only a paid developer team's profile grants — under free Personal Team signing the taps will fail, and that is the team talking, not the tag." = "任何 NDEF 标签都可以成为硬币：一张交通卡、一把酒店钥匙、一张空白卡。应用只保存标签的哈希，绝不保存其内容：花掉它意味着把它的出现与你选择的目标配对，节奏作为第二因素。";
