"Arm it, then check in here — deliberately, with the button — before the interval runs out. If the app is next opened with the check-in overdue, the Knocktalk threads burn and EMCON rises before anything else happens. It falls at the next OPENING, not at the deadline: iOS gives no app a background timer worth trusting. The reminders are courtesies. Merely opening the app never counts as a check-in — that is the point of the hand." = "给它上弦，然后在间隔结束之前——用按钮，故意地——在这里签到。如果下次打开应用时签到已逾期，Knocktalk 的线程会烧毁，EMCON 会在任何其他事情之前升起。它落在下一次打开时，而不是截止时：iOS 不给任何应用值得信任的后台计时器。提醒只是礼貌。仅仅打开应用永远不算签到——这正是那只手的用意。";
