"Counted from the canary's own sessions: the paths, topics, subjects, and client banners probers brought with them. Arming a path makes it bait — with the honeydrop on, asking for it is taking the drop." = "由金丝雀自己的会话统计：探测者带来的路径、主题、标题和客户端横幅，以及各自来访的次数。";
