"Duplicate block" = "复制块";
"Durable conclusions from the consolidation — each kept with its evidence and its birthday. Forget one and the mind remembers the forgetting: it will not quietly re-teach it tomorrow." = "来自整合的持久结论——每个都带着它的证据和生日保存。从一台设备遗忘会把它作为漂移消散，未来的漂移不会把它带回来。";
"Dwell" = "停留时长";
"EMCON" = "EMCON";
"EMCON active — emissions silenced, tripwire armed." = "EMCON 已激活——排放已静音，绊线已布防。";
"EMCON can verify the broadcast name and the app's emissions. These five live in Settings — check them off on your word." = "EMCON 可以验证广播名称与应用的发射。这五项在「设置」中——你能查的就自己查并勾上。拦截状态、应用是否在后台、VPN 终止开关、位置共享、系统遥测。";
"EMCON cannot hide this device from the access point it is joined to, and Apple's own radios (Find My, AirDrop) answer to Settings, not to this app. What EMCON strips is everything that identifies the device — and anyone who probes it announces themselves to the tripwire." = "EMCON 无法向它所连接的接入点隐藏此设备，而苹果自家的无线电（查找、向所有人开放时的隔空投送）自行做决定。";
"EMCON off — tripwire stood down. Stealth left as it was." = "EMCON 关闭——绊线已撤下。隐身保持原样。";
"Each new line names the hash of the sealed line before it. Verification proves no sealed line was altered, reordered, or removed from the middle of the log." = "每一行新行都命名了它之前那一行封存行的哈希值。验证可以证明没有一行封存行被改动、裁剪或重排——这就是它所证明的一切。";
"Each session is a JSON Lines file in Files › On My iPhone › nightjar › sessions, and shareable from the Sessions tab. On the Mac: nightjar report <file> and nightjar trackers <file>." = "每个会话都是位于“文件 › 我的 iPhone › nightjar › sessions”中的 JSON Lines 文件，可从“会话”标签页共享。在 Mac 上：nightjar report <文件> 和 nightjar trackers <文件>。";
