"The playlist — %lld block(s)" = "播放列表——%lld 个块";
"The quiet before a knock lands." = "敲门落下前的寂静。";
"The record" = "记录";
"The registry and timeline clear. Filed watches are kept." = "注册表和时间线清除。存档的观察记录保留。";
