"The revolving rack" = "旋转架";
"The ring" = "指环";
"The same sealed box as a knock, sung as tones: speaker to microphone, no network, no radio — it works in airplane mode. Short messages only (sound is a narrow pipe), and keep this tab open while listening. Heard chirps land in a thread named chirp." = "与敲击相同的封存盒子，用音调唱出：扬声器对麦克风，没有网络，没有无线电——在屏蔽的房间里也能工作。";
"The sealed box as a looping sequence of QR frames — for the room where even a chirp is too loud. The camera gathers frames until the set is whole; the loop forgives every miss. One-way, like sound: no acknowledgement rides the light back." = "将密封的盒子作为 QR 帧的循环序列——适用于连唧唧声都太大的房间。相机是耳朵；屏幕是嘴。";
"The sealed log file is deleted and the seal chain starts fresh. This cannot be undone." = "封印的日志文件被删除，封印链重新开始。这无法撤销。";
"The session recording right now is kept. This cannot be undone." = "正在录制的会话会被保留。此操作无法撤销。";
"The setup file would not write" = "设置文件无法写入";
"The shape" = "形态";
"The station's limits, in its own words: no spectrum beyond Bluetooth is available to any iOS app; Wi-Fi is visible only as the joined network plus what the census builds by knocking; identities are as emitters claim them, per channel, per epoch. Receive and observe — the station never interferes with the spectrum it watches." = "该站以自己的话说明其极限：任何 iOS 应用都无法获得蓝牙之外的频谱；Wi-Fi 对 iOS 而言以总量可见，以帧则不可见；扫描遵循 iOS 的节奏，其反复无常塑造了结果。";
"The steward" = "管家";
"The suit, as you cut it" = "这套西装，按你剪裁的样子";
"The tag" = "标签";
"The timing fingerprints learned for every peer are deleted. Cadence learns each hand again from its next knocks." = "为每个对等方学到的时序指纹被删除。节奏从每个手的裸节奏重新学习。";
"The transcript goes. What she remembers stays — forgetting that is its own act, under Reset." = "记录会消失。她记得的会留下——忘记那些是另一回事，在“重置”里。";
"The whole house in your language — every tab, setting and switch, and Skelli herself — the moment you choose it, with no relaunch. The room behind this door lists every tongue by its own name, shows the one in force, and turns the house for the languages that read right to left." = "整个房子用你的语言——每个标签页、设置和开关，还有斯凯利本人——在你选择的瞬间，无需重新启动。这扇门后的房间按每种语言自己的名字列出它们，显示正在生效的那个，并为从右向左读的语言转动房子。";
"The wire has drifted %lld time(s) since I started counting. Things change their stories slowly." = "自从我开始计数，线路已漂移 %lld 次。事物慢慢改变它们的故事。";
