"These are real listeners on the device that EMCON does not own — the OS, other apps, or Serve ports kept under stealth. The hardening list below is where the OS ones die." = "这些是设备上 EMCON 并不拥有的真实监听者——操作系统、其他应用，或保存在门后的 Serve 端口。";
