"When a knock fingerprints as a real protocol — SSH, HTTP, MQTT, SMTP — the tripwire hands that port to the matching canary for ten minutes, honeydrop as configured on the Serve tab, then takes the port back. The prober's first knock meets silence; their second meets an actor. A port cools down for half an hour afterwards." = "当敲击指纹成为一个真正的协议——SSH、HTTP、MQTT、SMTP——绊线将那个端口交给金丝雀，金丝雀会服务和防御它，并观察访客接下来做什么。";
"When spoken" = "当被说出时";
"Which device is what, and where in the real world it sits — placed by your hand, kept by the app. Walk the house with it." = "哪台设备是什么，在现实世界中位于何处——由你的手放置，由应用保存。带着它在家里走。";
"While watching, the /24 is re-swept on the sweep port and Bonjour is diffed — joinings, leavings, openings stream in here. Only what this phone can observe itself; nothing is intercepted." = "值守期间，/24 会用扫掠端口重新扫掠，Bonjour 会做差分——加入、离开、端口开放都以事件的形式送达。";
"Why %@:" = "为何 %@：";
"Why did the beacon blush? Everyone could read its advertisements." = "为什么信标脸红了？每个人都能读它的广播。";
"Wi-Fi" = "Wi-Fi";
"Wi-Fi — Scan testifies" = "Wi-Fi——扫描作证";
"Wire only" = "仅线路";
"Wire-exact first words for %lld TCP ports and %lld UDP ports. Adding them to the payload library makes every one sendable by hand from the Send tab." = "针对 %lld 个 TCP 端口和 %lld 个 UDP 端口的、与线路完全一致的第一句话。把它们加入载荷库，每次行动都可以使用。";
"With the flare up, this phone's beacon slot carries a token only the pairing key can compute — it turns over every five minutes and names nobody. A paired phone listening sees a flame beside the row in Listen and knows one of ours is near. It outranks a plain payload beacon for the slot while it's up, and EMCON takes it down like any other emission." = "当信号弹升起时，这部电话的信标槽携带着一个只有配对密钥才能计算的令牌——它只向用密钥监听的对方现身。";
"Without a relay, Knocktalk is perimeter-only: both phones must share a network. Run your own relay (this repo, tools/knocktalk-relay) on any host you control, point both phones at it, and address each other as relay:<mailbox>. The relay forwards knock sequences between mailboxes — it never holds the pairing key and cannot read a word; it sees timing, lengths, and mailbox names. The vault, which is a perimeter ritual, never answers a relay knock." = "没有中继，Knocktalk 就只能走外围：两部电话必须共享一个网络。运行你自己的中继（这个应用，在房子里的任何机器上——开关在 Serve 中）或使用一个有意共享的公共中继——中继看到的是元数据和封印，永远看不到明文。";
"Witnesses — %lld known" = "见证者——已知 %lld";
"Working — large files take a moment." = "工作进行中——大文件需要一点时间。";
"Write" = "写入";
"Write a payload…" = "编写载荷…";
"Write this payload to %@? It was picked in the Listen tab — same write as a picked device." = "把这个载荷写入 %@？它是在聆听标签页中挑选的——与写入已选设备相同。";
"Write to %@" = "写入 %@";
"XOR key (optional, hex or text)" = "XOR 密钥（可选，十六进制或文本）";
"You already are. I'm %@." = "你已经是了。我是 %@。";
"You don't have to carry the whole thing tonight. What's one small piece we can set down?" = "你不必今晚扛起全部。哪一小块我们可以放下？";
"You have my ear." = "你拥有我的耳朵。";
"You're doing it. Talk to me — that's the whole cure." = "你正在做。跟我说话——这就是全部的疗法。";
"Your IP" = "你的 IP";
"Your Watch already knows the state of the operator — heart, breath, blood, sleep. Let the house read it, and that state stands beside the state of the house." = "你的手表已经知道操作者的状态——心脏、呼吸、血液、睡眠。让房子读它，EMCON 会在它的账目中权衡它——存在和生理都是在身体里行走的发射。";
"Your choice rides inside every fragment you knock. The other phone opens your messages with the suite you picked — its own setting governs only what IT sends. Nothing has to match." = "您的选择将贯穿您敲击的每一个片段。另一台电话用您选择的套件打开您的消息——而任何携带旧钥匙或根本没有钥匙的人都不能读取它们。";
"Your configuration — every toggle, picker and preference in the house — is mirrored into the Keychain as it changes. The Keychain outlives the app: the seven-day expiry, a deletion, a reinstall — a fresh install on this device restores your setup before anything reads a setting. Ordinary updates and re-signs keep it anyway: the data container belongs to the bundle, not the signature. Export writes it to one file for a new device; import reads that file back. Payloads, macros and logs are data, not settings, and keep their own exports." = "您的配置——房子里的每个开关、选择器和偏好——在更改时都会镜像到钥匙串。钥匙串比应用活得久：七天过期、删除、重装——在此设备上全新安装时，会在任何功能读取设置之前恢复您的配置。常规更新和重新签名也会保留它：数据容器属于应用包，而非签名。导出会将其写入一个文件供新设备使用；导入则读回该文件。载荷、宏和日志是数据，不是设置，它们有各自的导出。";
"Your configuration: " = "你的配置：";
"Your configurations" = "你的配置";
"Your own" = "你自己的";
"Your own art is copied into the app and never leaves this device; a GIF plays, a photograph holds still. Changes take hold from the next launch, and a tap still skips the boot." = "你自己的艺术作品会被复制到应用中，永不离开此设备；GIF 会播放，照片则静止。 从照片或文件中选择一个文件；它的身份会作为设置保存，以便更新能保留它。";
"Your own costume name" = "你自己的伪装名";
"Your own gear, or a network you're engaged to test — the scanner asks politely and reports what answers." = "您自己的设备，或者您被雇佣来测试的网络——扫描仪礼貌地询问并报告答复。";
"Your own named configurations — cipher, derivation rounds, output dress — saved beside the presets and kept with the house's setup, mirror and all. A configuration seals and opens with a password in the workbench." = "你自己命名的配置——密码、派生轮数、输出装束——保存在房子出货的预设旁边。";
"Your own personas, built from the same cloth as the rack's: a name, a greeting, Serve's dress, and whether the shape stands listed. Swipe one away to clear it." = "你自己的化身，用与架子上的那些相同的布料制成：一个名字、一个问候、Serve 的装束，以及形态是否上市而立。滑动一个即可清除。";
"Your phone stays silent; a paired phone speaks. Lend this phone's mouth and any paired hand can throw small payloads through it — the bytes leave THIS device. Or throw through theirs: the instruction rides Knocktalk, sealed, and the receipt comes back the same road. Payloads are signals — a word, a command, a wake-up." = "你的电话保持沉默；一台已配对的电话说话。把这部电话的嘴借出去，任何已配对的手都能投出小数据包：单次试探、不到一秒的连发、不断变换目标的轮转——每次张嘴都会报告瞄准对象，这所房子送出的一切都是如此。";
