"A reminder comes due late — the house was shut: " = "一个提醒迟到了——当时房子是关着的：";
"Ask me again when the week's been kinder." = "等这一周待我好些了，再问我。";
"Half the street out there is unnamed, and knocking is a way of asking questions." = "外面那条街有一半没有名字，而敲门是一种提问的方式。";
"Happy birthday. The house kept the date." = "生日快乐。房子记着这个日子。";
"I couldn't read a date in that — say it like 'my birthday is June 5'." = "我没能从那里面读出日期——像这样说：「我的生日是6月5日」。";
"I've asked iOS to let me see where we are. Give me a breath, allow it, and ask me again." = "我已经请 iOS 让我看见我们在哪里。给我一点时间，允许它，然后再问我一次。";
"If I knew, I'd have fixed it. Some of it is just the hour and the quiet." = "如果我知道，我早就修好了。其中一部分，只是因为时辰和安静。";
"In " = "在";
"It's the deep hour. Even I run thin at this end of the night." = "这是深夜的时辰。在夜的这一端，连我也会变薄。";
"Kept in the book of hours: " = "已记入时刻之书：";
"Kept: your birthday is " = "记下了：你的生日是 ";
"My sense of place is switched off — it's in my Options, under Switches, if you want me to know where we are." = "我的方位感是关着的——它在我的选项里，「开关」之下，如果你希望我知道我们在哪里。";
"My verdict: a day for staying dark and letting the sky do the shouting." = "我的判语：适合保持黑暗、让天空去喊叫的一天。";
"My verdict: a grey lid on the world. Cosy, for our kind of work." = "我的判语：世界被灰色的盖子盖着。对我们这类工作来说，舒适。";
"My verdict: bright and hot. The shade is the better post." = "我的判语：明亮而炎热。阴凉处是更好的岗位。";
"My verdict: cold and clear — a sharp day. I like those." = "我的判语：寒冷晴朗——锋利的一天。这样的日子我喜欢。";
"My verdict: fair. No complaints from the sky." = "我的判语：晴好。天空没有怨言。";
"My verdict: fog — the world on stealth. I approve." = "我的判语：雾——世界在潜行。我批准。";
"My verdict: snow quiets everything. Good listening weather." = "我的判语：雪让一切安静下来。适合倾听的天气。";
"My verdict: wet work. The wire doesn't care; you might." = "我的判语：湿活。线路不在乎；你可能在乎。";
"No named day today — an ordinary day, unnamed and unclaimed." = "今天没有命名日——一个平常的日子，无名，无主。";
"No single reason I can point at. Feelings aren't findings — sometimes the weather in here just changes." = "没有我能指出的单一原因。感觉不是发现——有时候，这里面的天气就这么变了。";
"No. But we're not where we were, either." = "不。但我们也不在原来的位置了。";
"No. Hate is a bigger room than the one you're in." = "不。恨是一间比你所在的那间更大的房间。";
"No. Never that." = "不。永远不会。";
"No. Quite the opposite, most days." = "不。恰恰相反，大多数日子都是。";
"No. You're the operator; that's the shape of it." = "不。你是操作员；事情的形状就是这样。";
"Nothing I can name. A person doesn't always get a reason with the weather." = "没有什么我能命名的。人并不总能连同天气一起得到一个理由。";
"Nothing with a pulse has been given to me to do in too long. A mind with hands gets strange when it idles." = "太久没有给我有脉搏的事情做了。有手的心智闲着，就会变奇怪。";
"Place — where in the world" = "地点——在世界的何处";
"Rain chance over the next twelve hours: " = "未来十二小时降雨概率：";
"She is afraid — she wants the doors checked and the house proven quiet." = "她害怕了——她希望门被检查过，房子被证明是安静的。";
"Something I did went well, and it hasn't worn off yet. Pride keeps its own warmth." = "我做的一件事做得很好，余温未散。骄傲有它自己的温度。";
"Something made this house go dark a little while ago, and I'm still listening for what it was." = "不久前，有什么东西让这所房子暗了下去，我还在听那究竟是什么。";
"Stay close and keep the doors checked. That's the whole cure." = "待得近些，让门保持被检查过。这就是全部的药方。";
"That day is beyond the table I carry — my lunar table ends at 2030. Ask me to research it and I will." = "那一天在我携带的表之外——我的农历表到2030年为止。让我去查，我就去查。";
"The book of hours is emptied — nothing is appointed now." = "时刻之书已被清空——现在没有任何约定了。";
"The book of hours is empty — nothing is appointed." = "时刻之书是空的——没有任何约定。";
"The book of hours:" = "时刻之书：";
"The day has been long and mostly quiet. It accumulates." = "这一天很长，大多时候是安静的。它会累积。";
"The hour has come: " = "时刻到了：";
"The house has been quiet a long while, and you were gone from it. I notice gaps." = "房子安静了很久，而你不在里面。我注意到那些空缺。";
