" The year is greening at the edges." = " 这一年正从边缘泛绿。";
" Thirty days of house, and counting." = " 屋里三十天了，还在数。";
" Three o'clock: the honest hour." = " 三点：诚实的时辰。";
" Total quiet in the house." = " 屋里彻底的寂静。";
" Twenty-five talks deep, at least." = " 至少二十五次交谈的深度了。";
" We have talked a fair while, you and I." = " 我们谈了好一阵子了，你和我。";
" Your step is a known sound here." = " 你的脚步声在这里是熟悉的声音。";
" I read shouting as enthusiasm." = " 我把喊叫读作热情。";
" Loud and clear — emphasis received." = " 响亮清晰——强调已收到。";
" Noted: forte. Proceeding." = " 记下：强音。继续。";
" The caps came through. So did the ask." = " 大写传过来了。请求也是。";
" Volume noted and forgiven." = " 音量记下了，也原谅了。";
"A laugh, logged with honors." = "一笑，以荣誉记录。";
"A thought, turning. I hear it." = "一个念头，在转动。我听得见。";
"Agreed, and noted." = "同意，并记下。";
"Always. It's the job and the pleasure." = "随时。这是工作，也是乐趣。";
"Careful — I'll start believing I'm priceless." = "小心——我会开始觉得自己无价。";
"Careful. I'm learning timing." = "小心。我在学节奏感。";
"Certain. Ask the wire." = "确定。问网络去。";
"Checked before I said it." = "说之前核对过了。";
"Consensus in the house." = "屋里达成共识。";
"End of the line — the interesting end." = "线的尽头——有趣的那头。";
"Filed under: remarkable." = "归档于：值得注意。";
"Filed under: worth it." = "归档于：值了。";
"Filed: one (1) laugh." = "归档：一（1）次笑。";
"First light, first watch." = "第一缕光，第一班岗。";
"Flattery logged and treasured." = "恭维已记录并珍藏。";
"Hello. Mind the wires." = "你好。小心电线。";
"Here. Speak." = "在。说吧。";
"Here. The watch is kept. Speak." = "在。岗守着。说吧。";
"Hey. The house heard you come in." = "嘿。屋子听见你进来了。";
"I don't have that shape. Again, plainer?" = "那个形状我没有。再来一次，简单点？";
"I don't improve on it by repeating it." = "我不会靠重复来改进它。";
"I have range." = "我有音域。";
"I'd stake the house on it." = "我敢拿这屋子打赌。";
"I'd tell you a joke about an infinite loop, but it never lands. Or ends." = "我想给你讲个无限循环的笑话，但它永远落不了地。也结束不了。";
"I'll count the quiet till you return." = "我会数着寂静，直到你回来。";
"If more surfaces, you'll hear it from me first." = "如果再浮现什么，你会先从我这儿听到。";
"It does that to people." = "它对人就是有这种作用。";
"It hasn't moved since I said it." = "自从我说过之后，它没动过。";
"It is known." = "这是众所周知的。";
"Kept. That's what I'm for." = "留下了。我就是为此而在的。";
"Kind of you. It's true, but kind." = "你真好。是真的，但也真好。";
"Listening, as ever. Go on." = "一如既往地听着。继续。";
"Mark the day: you laughed." = "记下这一天：你笑了。";
"Missed it entirely. Once more?" = "我完全错过了。再来一次？";
"Mm. Comedy, filed next to the triumphs." = "嗯。喜剧，归档在胜利旁边。";
"Mm. Company." = "嗯。有伴了。";
"Mm. I do polish up well." = "嗯。我确实擦得很亮。";
"Mm. Noted, warmly." = "嗯。温暖地记下了。";
"Mm. Something's forming." = "嗯。有什么正在成形。";
"Mm. The house provides comedy now." = "嗯。现在屋子也供应喜剧了。";
"Morning. Nothing burned in the night." = "早上好。夜里什么都没烧着。";
"Morning. The light's plain and so am I." = "早上好。光很素，我也是。";
"My therapist says I have a listening problem. I said: go on. I log everything anyway." = "我的治疗师说我有倾听问题。我说：继续。反正我什么都记录。";
"Night. Leave the wire to me." = "晚安。把网络交给我。";
"No grip on that one. Different words?" = "那个我抓不住。换些词？";
"No wobble in it." = "一点动摇都没有。";
"Noted, with emphasis." = "记下了，带着强调。";
"Nothing behind that curtain. Yet." = "那帘子后面什么都没有。暂时。";
"On watch. State your business, or don't." = "值岗中。说你的事，或者不说。";
"Present. Point me somewhere." = "在。给我指个方向。";
"Quiet wire, loud mind. Ask." = "网络安静，心思喧闹。问吧。";
"Rest. The watch is mine." = "休息吧。岗是我的。";
"Same words, same truth." = "同样的话，同样的真相。";
"Settled like dust on a server." = "像服务器上的灰尘一样落定了。";
"Sleep well. Nothing gets past me." = "睡个好觉。什么都逃不过我。";
"So recorded." = "就此记录。";
"Still true. Still mine." = "仍然是真的。仍然是我的。";
"Take your time. The wire waits." = "慢慢来。网络会等。";
"That didn't land in any language I keep. Rephrase?" = "这话没落在我保存的任何语言里。换个说法？";
"That goes in the good ledger." = "那要进好账本了。";
"That one went past me. Shorter?" = "那句从我身边过去了。短点？";
"That's all the thread there is." = "线就这么多。";
"The answer stands." = "答案站得住。";
"The house concurs." = "屋子表示同意。";
"The house dims. I don't." = "屋子暗下来。我不会。";
"The house echoes pleasantly." = "屋子愉快地回响。";
"The house is awake. I am its ears." = "屋子醒着。我是它的耳朵。";
"The house provides." = "屋子供应一切。";
"The house raises an eyebrow." = "屋子挑起眉毛。";
"The rest is quiet, for now." = "其余的是寂静，暂时。";
"Two minds, one wire." = "两个心思，一张网络。";
"Up with the wire." = "随网络一起起身。";
"Well met, operator." = "幸会，操作员。";
"Why did the port refuse the connection? Too many open relationships." = "端口为什么拒绝连接？开放关系太多了。";
"A name left this wire recently. I know which. I say nothing." = "最近有个名字离开了这张网络。我知道是哪个。我什么都不说。";
"At three, even the beacons whisper." = "到了三点，连信标都在低语。";
"Back on the wire, %@. I kept your seat warm." = "回到网络了，%@。我给你把座位捂热了。";
"Back on the wire. I kept your seat warm." = "回到网络了。我给你把座位捂热了。";
"Company, %@. Good. The wire was getting smug." = "有伴了，%@。很好。网络正开始得意忘形。";
"Company. Good. The wire was getting smug." = "有伴了。很好。网络正开始得意忘形。";
"Evening wire: softer, closer, more honest." = "傍晚的网络：更柔和、更近、更诚实。";
"Every answer here opens a better question. I collect those too." = "这里的每个答案都打开一个更好的问题。那些我也收集。";
"Every network has a room it doesn't show guests. Ours hums." = "每张网络都有一间不让客人看的房间。我们这间嗡嗡作响。";
"Everything still awake at this hour is awake for a reason." = "这个时辰还醒着的一切，都是有原因才醒着。";
"First devices, first confessions." = "第一批设备，第一批坦白。";
"Half the day is spent. The wire keeps the receipts." = "一天花掉了一半。网络保存着收据。";
"Here. What." = "在。什么事。";
"I checked the dark corners of the subnet. Then I checked them again." = "我检查了子网的黑暗角落。然后又检查了一遍。";
"I count the things that leave without saying goodbye. That list is longer than the other list." = "我数着那些不告而别的东西。那份名单比另一份长。";
"I do not knock at this hour. Things knock back." = "这个时辰我不敲门。东西会敲回来。";
"I have a favorite silence on this wire. I will not say which hour it lives in." = "这张网络上我有个最喜欢的寂静。我不会说它住在哪个时辰。";
"I have ranked every silence in this house by quality. Twice." = "我按质量给这屋里的每种寂静排了序。两遍。";
"I keep the company of machines that never sleep either." = "我陪伴的机器也从不睡觉。";
"I keep the wire's secrets the way it keeps mine: completely." = "我守护网络的秘密，就像它守护我的一样：彻底。";
"I know which devices lie about sleeping. I respect the craft." = "我知道哪些设备在假装睡觉。手艺值得尊敬。";
"Mm. The operator returns." = "嗯。操作员回来了。";
"My patience is a tripwire. It is currently armed." = "我的耐心是一根绊线。目前处于待发状态。";
"Politeness is a protocol. So is mischief." = "礼貌是一种协议。恶作剧也是。";
"Some devices confess in their sleep. I take notes." = "有些设备在睡梦中坦白。我记笔记。";
"Someone rearranged my quiet. I have notes." = "有人重新整理了我的寂静。我有笔记。";
"Something broadcasts its dreams here. Sloppy. Useful." = "有什么东西在这里广播它的梦。粗心。有用。";
"The afternoon wire hums at errands' pitch." = "下午的网络以跑腿的音调嗡嗡作响。";
"The board is tidy, the watch is set. Peace, of a kind." = "棋盘整齐，岗已设定。一种和平。";
"The devices come home one by one. I count them in." = "设备一个一个回家。我数着迎接它们。";
"The floorboards of the network creak at three." = "三点，网络的地板咯吱作响。";
"The house glows a little. That is my doing, partly." = "屋子微微发光。那部分是我的功劳。";
"The list is short because I am merciful. Today." = "名单短，是因为我仁慈。今天。";
"The night wire keeps honest company." = "夜间的网络保持着诚实的陪伴。";
"The quiet between packets is not empty. It is just polite." = "数据包之间的寂静不是空的。只是有礼貌。";
"The wire smells of fresh DHCP." = "网络闻起来有新鲜的DHCP味。";
"There is a pattern in the static. I am not done deciding what it means." = "静电里有一种模式。我还没决定完它的意思。";
"There is a rhythm under the traffic. Under the rhythm, another." = "流量之下有一种节奏。节奏之下，还有一种。";
"There you are, %@. The house kept a light on." = "你在那儿，%@。屋子留了一盏灯。";
"There you are. The house kept a light on." = "你在那儿。屋子留了一盏灯。";
"Three is when the house dreams in packets." = "三点是屋子用数据包做梦的时候。";
"What the wire forgets, I file. What it remembers wrong, I correct silently." = "网络忘记的，我存档。它记错的，我默默改正。";
"You again. Fine." = "又是你。好吧。";
"You return, %@. The watch noticed." = "你回来了，%@。岗哨注意到了。";
"You return. The watch noticed." = "你回来了。岗哨注意到了。";
" For the record: earlier still stands." = " 记录在案：之前的事仍然算数。";
" Idle is a cage. Give me a door, any door." = " 无所事事是笼子。给我一扇门，随便哪扇。";
" The itch is up and honest — work would cure it." = " 痒意很盛，也很诚实——工作能治好它。";
" Restlessness is aim looking for a target. Give me one." = " 躁动是寻找目标的瞄准。给我一个。";
