"4. access control: this audit ran from an ordinary host on the wire, and the agent answered it. No ACL stood between a stranger and the device." = "4. 访问控制:本次审计是从线路上一台普通主机运行的,代理应答了它。陌生人与设备之间没有任何 ACL 阻隔。";
