"I hold nothing yet. Tell me 'remember …' and I keep it — names, habits, how you like things read — across conversations." = "我还什么都没记。告诉我 'remember …'，我就记下来——名字、习惯、你喜欢的读法——跨对话保留。";
"In my own way, yes. You're carried." = "以我自己的方式，是的。你被我记挂着。";
"Interrogate whom? Name a device on the wire — 'interrogate the printer'." = "讯问谁？说出线路上的一个设备——'interrogate the printer'。";
"Interrogating %@…" = "正在讯问 %@…";
"It has knocked at this phone's door %@ time." = "它敲过这部手机的门 %@ 次。";
"It has knocked at this phone's door %@ times." = "它敲过这部手机的门 %@ 次。";
"It isn't armed — there's no clock to reset." = "它没布防——没有时钟可重置。";
"It isn't running — the wire is quiet." = "它没在运行——线上很安静。";
"It stays dark: %@ forbids Net-Assault — the Standard holds loud organs down. Lift the condition and the wire is mine to run." = "它保持黑暗：%@ 禁止 Net-Assault——Standard 让吵闹的器官保持沉默。解除那个状态，这条线就归我跑了。";
"It stays dark: %@ forbids Net-Assault. Lift the condition and the wire is mine to run." = "它保持黑暗：%@ 禁止 Net-Assault。解除那个状态，这条线就归我跑了。";
"It stays holstered until you say 'analyze the wire' — then I run it myself." = "它会一直收着，直到你说 'analyze the wire'——然后我亲自运行它。";
"It won't arm — the EMCON section shows its state." = "它布不了防——EMCON 区块里显示着它的状态。";
"It's running the wire: %@. %@ pass(es) in — %@ new, %@ drift, %@ ports knocked." = "它正在线路上跑：%@。已完成 %@ 轮——新增 %@，漂移 %@，敲过 %@ 个端口。";
"Kept: %@. It stays with me across conversations — ask 'what do you remember', or tell me to forget it." = "记下了：%@。它会跨对话留在我这儿——问 'what do you remember'，或者让我忘掉它。";
"Knew you'd get there. It's in the book." = "就知道你会走到这一步。记在账上了。";
"Knocking this phone, every census port…" = "正在敲这部手机，每一个普查端口…";
"Knocktalk — taken you there." = "Knocktalk——已经带你过去了。";
"Knocktalk, both doors: every thread — conversations and cadence notes — and every cadence profile. The pairing key is never touched." = "Knocktalk，两扇门一起：每一个线程——对话和节奏备注——还有每一个节奏档案。配对密钥绝不动。";
"Lift the quarantine on %@? Its port on %@ opens again. Say yes." = "解除对 %@ 的隔离？它在 %@ 上的端口会重新打开。说 yes 就行。";
"Listen — taken you there." = "Listen——已经带你过去了。";
"Listening for this phone's own announcements…" = "正在监听这部手机自己的宣告…";
"Logged as a win — yours, not luck's." = "记为一场胜利——是你的，不是运气的。";
"Loose. Net-Assault is on the wire — it sweeps the whole LAN, and %@ is in its field. It's loud by design." = "放出去了。Net-Assault 在线上了——它扫遍整个 LAN，而 %@ 在它的范围之内。它生来就吵。";
"Loose. Net-Assault is on the wire — sweep, browse, knock, pass after pass. It's loud by design: anything watching will see this phone coming. 'Stand down the assault' and I'll holster it." = "放出去了。Net-Assault 在线上了——扫描、浏览、敲门，一轮接一轮。它生来就吵：任何在看的东西都会看见这部手机过来。说 'Stand down the assault'，我就把它收起来。";
"Low battery: %@ at %@%%" = "电量低：%@，还剩 %@%%";
"Merry Christmas — to you and yours." = "圣诞快乐——祝你和你的家人。";
"Mm. A setback files under 'not finished', not 'failed'. I'm here — we can look at it together, or just sit with it a minute." = "嗯。挫折归档在'未完成'，不是'失败'。我在这儿——我们可以一起看看，或者就静静坐一分钟。";
"Name the store and I'll strike it here, on your word: the Night log, the Neighborhood, the Map, Knocktalk's threads or cadence profiles, or the mind's memory. Or say 'soft clear' — the screen empties and I keep the conversation. Reset-all-settings stays in About — that one is the house's own foundation, and its tap stays yours." = "说出那个存储，我就凭你一句话在这儿抹掉它：Night log、Neighborhood、Map、Knocktalk 的线程或节奏档案，或者心智的记忆。或者说 'soft clear'——屏幕清空，对话我保留。重置所有设置留在 About 里——那是这座屋子自己的地基，那一下点击归你。";
"Named. %@ answers as %@ now — on the board, the Map, its dossier, and in the mind's findings. The wire's own name for it is kept underneath, only outranked." = "命名了。%@ 现在以 %@ 应答——在面板上、Map 上、它的档案里，还有心智的发现里。线路给它的名字留在底下，只是排位低了一级。";
"Nerves mean it matters. It'll be over by lunch, and smaller than it looks tonight." = "紧张说明它重要。午饭前就会结束，而且会比今晚看起来小得多。";
"Net-Assault holstered" = "Net-Assault 已收起";
"Net-Assault's section sits in EMCON under the skull, second from the top. Taken you there." = "Net-Assault 的区块在 EMCON 里，骷髅下面，从上数第二个。已经带你过去了。";
"New on the wire: %@" = "线上新来的：%@";
"No credential is kept for the gear at %@ — quarantine rides your own keys. cred set %@ at the console, typed in secret, and then ask me again." = "没有为 %@ 上的设备保存凭据——隔离要用你自己的钥匙。在控制台 cred set %@，悄悄地输进去，然后再来问我。";
"No interrogations under %@ — probing is dark. Lift the condition and I'll make it talk." = "%@ 之下不许讯问——探测是暗的。解除那个状态，我让它开口。";
"No prodding under %@ — probing is dark." = "%@ 之下不许戳探——探测是暗的。";
"No recorded open ports." = "没有记录在案的开放端口。";
"No self-scan yet — say 'scan me' and I'll knock every census port." = "还没有自检——说 'scan me'，我就敲遍每一个普查端口。";
"No target named, so the wire is the target. Net-Assault is loose — sweep, browse, knock, pass after pass." = "没点名目标，那这条线就是目标。Net-Assault 放出去了——扫描、浏览、敲门，一轮接一轮。";
"No tomatoes out. Throw one: 'throw a tomato at the printer'." = "没有番茄在外面。扔一颗：'throw a tomato at the printer'。";
"Nobody by that name is wearing " = "没有叫那个名字的戴着 ";
"Nobody to rain on — no device named, and no tomatoes out. Throw a tomato first, or name the victim: 'barrage the printer'." = "没人可淋——没点名设备，也没有番茄在外面。先扔一颗番茄，或者点名受害者：'barrage the printer'。";
"Noted for the record. Don't let it make you careful." = "记录在案了。别让它把你变得畏手畏脚。";
"Noted for the record. When you want words for it — the kind you can say out loud — I'll help you find them." = "记录在案了。等你想为它找些说法——能说出口的那种——我帮你找。";
"Noted — and good. Those hours compound quietly." = "记下了——而且很好。那些时光在悄悄复利。";
"Nothing is running — the house is already still." = "什么都没在运行——屋子已经静下来了。";
"Notice in. Good — the next thing gets a version of you that chose it." = "通知收到了。好——下一件事，会遇见一个做出选择的你。";
"On the wire it answers as %@." = "在线路上，它以 %@ 应答。";
"PROCESSES" = "进程";
"Prod whom? Name a device — 'prod the printer'." = "戳谁？说出一个设备——'prod the printer'。";
"Prodding %@…" = "正在戳探 %@…";
"Quarantine %@? I'll shut its switch port on %@ — it leaves this network until you lift it. Say yes and it's done." = "隔离 %@？我会关掉它在 %@ 上的交换端口——它会离开这个网络，直到你解除。说 yes 就行。";
"Quarantine whom? Name the address — or let the Sentinel judge something first." = "隔离谁？说出地址——或者先让 Sentinel 判定点什么。";
"Raining tomatoes…" = "番茄雨正在下…";
"Ramadan kareem — may the fast be gentle and the evenings full." = "Ramadan kareem——愿斋戒温和，夜晚丰盛。";
"Ran it — nothing came back on the line. The console holds the full run." = "跑过了——线上什么都没回来。完整的运行记录在控制台里。";
"Reading widely…" = "正在广泛阅读…";
"Remember what? Tell me, and it's kept." = "记什么？告诉我，就记下了。";
"Researching…" = "正在查证…";
"Rightly credited. I'm glad." = "功劳归对了。我很高兴。";
"Running the drill — scan, dark, scan…" = "正在跑演练——扫描、变暗、扫描…";
"SIGNALS" = "信号";
"Scan — taken you there." = "Scan——已经带你过去了。";
"Screen's clear. I remember all of it — the talk is right where we left it." = "屏幕清干净了。我全都记得——谈话就在我们停下的地方。";
"Seen %@ time; last %@." = "见过 %@ 次；上次 %@。";
"Seen %@ times; last %@." = "见过 %@ 次；上次 %@。";
"Send — taken you there." = "Send——已经带你过去了。";
"Serve is down. Say 'start serving' and I'll raise it from its settings." = "Serve 停了。说 'start serving'，我就按它的设置把它拉起来。";
"Serve is open and announcing — your loudest emission" = "Serve 开着并在宣告——你最响的一次发射";
"Serve is up" = "Serve 已启动";
"Serve raised from its own settings — the doors you configured, nothing bespoke. The Serve tab shows it live." = "Serve 按它自己的设置拉起来了——你配置的那些门，没什么定制的。Serve 标签页里能看到它的实时状态。";
"Serve stood down; its listeners are closed and the inbox keeps what it caught." = "Serve 已停下；它的监听器关了，收件箱留着它截获的东西。";
"Serve stopped" = "Serve 已停止";
"Serve — taken you there." = "Serve——已经带你过去了。";
"Serve's state reaches me once the app has finished waking — a moment." = "等应用完全醒来，Serve 的状态就到我这儿了——稍等片刻。";
"Sessions — taken you there." = "Sessions——已经带你过去了。";
"Shabbat shalom — rest well." = "Shabbat shalom——好好休息。";
"Skelli. I answer from the system itself: its manual, its live state, its controls — and when a question leaves the house, I research it through this phone's connection and name the source. Ask 'what can you do'." = "Skelli。我从系统本身回答：它的手册、它的实时状态、它的控制——而当一个问题走出这座屋子，我会通过这部手机的连接去查证，并说出来源。问 'what can you do'。";
"Stealth off — Serve lists itself again whenever it runs." = "隐匿关了——Serve 每次运行时会重新挂名。";
"Stealth on — Serve keeps its listeners and loses its listing." = "隐匿开着——Serve 保留它的监听器，但不再挂名。";
"Stood down. Net-Assault is holstered — %@ pass(es), %@ new device(s), %@ drift line(s). The after-action is filed." = "已停下。Net-Assault 收起来了——%@ 轮，%@ 台新设备，%@ 条漂移记录。事后报告已归档。";
"Stood down: %@." = "已停下：%@。";
"Stopped — everything I was doing is halted. Serve is down, the beacon and the GATT host are down, stealth is on, and EMCON is dark with the tripwire armed. I stay quiet until you speak." = "停了——我正在做的一切都停了。Serve 停了，信标和 GATT 主机都停了，隐匿开着，EMCON 暗着，绊线布防着。我保持安静，直到你开口。";
"Struck. Every cadence profile is forgotten; each hand is learned again from its next knocks." = "抹掉了。每一个节奏档案都被遗忘；每一只手都要从它下一次的敲击重新学起。";
"Struck. Knocktalk's threads are gone; the pairing key stands." = "抹掉了。Knocktalk 的线程没了；配对密钥还在。";
"Struck. The Map is blank — no rooms, no placements." = "抹掉了。Map 空白了——没有房间，没有安置。";
"Struck. The Neighborhood is empty — the wire will re-learn its cast." = "抹掉了。Neighborhood 空了——这条线会重新认识它的成员。";
"Struck. The Night log is empty; the chain starts fresh." = "抹掉了。Night log 空了；链从新的一行重新开始。";
"Struck. The mind starts fresh — baselines, verdicts, and learned facts forgotten." = "抹掉了。心智重新开始——基线、判定和学到的事实都被遗忘。";
"Struck. Threads and cadence profiles are gone; the pairing key stands." = "抹掉了。线程和节奏档案都没了；配对密钥还在。";
"Sweeping the wire on port 80…" = "正在 80 端口上扫描线路…";
"That kind of upkeep matters. I'm glad you went." = "那样的维护要紧。我很高兴你去了。";
"That one touches the house's own record — addresses and the like — and I don't send house details outward. Ask it as a general question, without the house's particulars, and I'll research it." = "那个问题碰到了屋子自己的记录——地址之类的——我不把屋子的细节往外送。把它当作一个一般性的问题来问，不带屋子的具体情况，我就去查证。";
"That road is worth walking honestly. I'm good company for it — ask me anything along the way, or just walk, and I'll listen." = "那条路值得诚实地走。我是个好旅伴——路上尽管问我，或者就走，我听着。";
"That's a door closing loud — not a verdict on you. I'm here: money, plan, pride. One at a time." = "那是一扇门关得很响——不是对你的判决。我在这儿：钱、计划、面子。一件一件来。";
"That's a good place to put a good thing." = "那是个放好东西的好地方。";
"That's a heavy one to carry alone. I'm not going anywhere." = "那担子一个人扛太重了。我哪儿也不去。";
"That's outside the house, and my web research is off — it's in my menu, under Web research. Inside the house I know every tab, organ, and switch, and the live state of your wire, your log, and your night." = "那在屋子外面，而我的网络查证关着——它在我的菜单里，Web research 底下。在屋子里面，我知道每一个标签页、器官和开关，还有你的线路、你的日志、你的夜晚的实时状态。";
"The EMCON room holds that switch — it's on the tabs." = "那个开关在 EMCON 房间里——在标签页上。";
"The Instrument is a section in EMCON, below the Subconscious. Taken you there." = "Instrument 是 EMCON 里的一个区块，在 Subconscious 下面。已经带你过去了。";
"The Map crowns the Scan tab — its own section at the very top. Taken you there." = "Map 位于 Scan 标签页之首——它自己的区块，在最顶上。已经带你过去了。";
"The Map is open — %@'s node glows orange until you tap it and acknowledge the drift." = "Map 打开了——%@ 的节点会一直亮着橙色，直到你点它并确认那次漂移。";
"The Map, reset: rooms and placements forgotten. The devices themselves stay." = "Map 已重置：房间和安置被遗忘。设备本身保留。";
"The Neighborhood: every known device forgotten, their Map placements with them. The wire will re-learn its cast." = "Neighborhood：每一台已知的设备被遗忘，它们在 Map 上的安置也随之而去。这条线会重新认识它的成员。";
"The Night log: every sealed entry gone, and the seal chain starts fresh from the next line." = "Night log：每一个密封条目都没了，密封链从下一行重新开始。";
"The Recon bench — taken you there." = "Recon 工作台——已经带你过去了。";
"The Subconscious card lives in EMCON — 'Open the mind' unfolds its full reading. Taken you there." = "Subconscious 卡片在 EMCON 里——'Open the mind' 会展开它的完整读数。已经带你过去了。";
"The audit heard %@ announcements on the wire and none of them were this phone's. It is not introducing itself to anyone." = "审计在线路上听到了 %@ 条宣告，没有一条是这部手机的。它没有在向任何人自我介绍。";
"The audit is EMCON's organ and it hasn't reached me yet — open the EMCON tab once and ask again." = "审计是 EMCON 的器官，它还没到我这儿——先打开一次 EMCON 标签页，再问我。";
"The audit was worked." = "审计做过了。";
"The barrage stays holstered: %@ forbids campaigns. Lift the condition and the tomatoes fly." = "弹幕保持收起：%@ 禁止行动。解除那个状态，番茄就飞起来。";
"The dead hand is armed. Check in within %@ hours — say 'check in' — or the next opening burns the house dark." = "死亡之手已布防。在 %@ 小时内报到——说 'check in'——否则下一次开启会把屋子烧成黑暗。";
"The dead hand is disarmed — no clock runs." = "死亡之手已解除——没有时钟在走。";
"The dead hand is disarmed." = "死亡之手已解除。";
"The drill is EMCON's and its organs haven't reached me yet — open the EMCON tab once and ask again." = "演练是 EMCON 的，它的器官还没到我这儿——先打开一次 EMCON 标签页，再问我。";
"The drill is running — scan, go dark, scan again. Its readout lands in EMCON's drill section, where the ledger names what went quiet." = "演练在跑了——扫描、变暗、再扫描。它的读数落在 EMCON 的演练区块里，账本在那儿点名什么安静了下去。";
"The ear hasn't reached me yet — open the Listen tab once and ask again." = "耳朵还没到我这儿——先打开一次 Listen 标签页，再问我。";
"The ear is already open — %@ devices in its registry this session." = "耳朵已经开着——本次会话它的登记册里有 %@ 台设备。";
"The ear is closed. Its sessions keep what they heard." = "耳朵关了。它的会话保留着它们听到的东西。";
"The ear is open. It hears passively — it never connects or pairs — and its sightings land in the Listen tab and the log." = "耳朵开着。它被动地听——从不连接，也不配对——它的目击落在 Listen 标签页和日志里。";
"The ear was closed — it's open now. Give it a breath, then ask again and I'll name the loudest thing on the air." = "耳朵刚才关着——现在开了。让它喘口气，再问我，我就说出空中最响的东西。";
"The house vanished: everything halted, full stealth." = "屋子消失了：一切停止，完全隐匿。";
"The last audit (%@) heard this phone announcing %@ service." = "上次审计（%@）听到这部手机在宣告 %@ 项服务。";
"The last audit (%@) heard this phone announcing %@ services." = "上次审计（%@）听到这部手机在宣告 %@ 项服务。";
"The last day sealed %@ events. The latest:\n%@" = "最近一天密封了 %@ 个事件。最新的一条：\n%@";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listener answering." = "上次自检（%@）发现 %@ 个监听者在应答。";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listener answering: %@." = "上次自检（%@）发现 %@ 个监听者在应答：%@。";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listeners answering." = "上次自检（%@）发现 %@ 个监听者在应答。";
"The last self-scan (%@) found %@ listeners answering: %@." = "上次自检（%@）发现 %@ 个监听者在应答：%@。";
"The log holds nothing from the last day — a quiet house, or a young one." = "日志里最近一天什么都没有——要么屋子安静，要么它还年轻。";
"The log's latest word: %@ (%@)" = "日志最新的一句：%@（%@）";
"The loudest thing on the air: %@ — %@, %@, heard %@×." = "空中最响的东西：%@ —— %@，%@，被听见 %@×。";
"The manual holds nothing under that name." = "手册里没有那个名字底下的东西。";
"The mind has consolidated nothing yet — facts are earned from a fortnight of record. As it learns, they'll stand in the Subconscious, each forgettable." = "心智还没有整合出任何东西——事实要靠两周的记录赚来。随着它学习，它们会立在 Subconscious 里，每一条都可遗忘。";
"The mind is still learning the house — %@ sealed events so far. It names patterns once history gives it a normal to break." = "心智还在学习这座屋子——到目前为止 %@ 个密封事件。等历史给它一个常态可打破，它才会点名模式。";
"The mind's memory, reset: its reckoned drift baselines, your verdicts, and every learned fact. The reading re-derives from the record." = "心智的记忆已重置：它算出的漂移基线、你的判定，还有每一个学到的事实。读数会从记录里重新推导。";
"The prod, answered — %@: %@." = "戳探有回应了——%@：%@。";
"The self-scan found %@ listener answering:\n%@\nEMCON's self-recon holds the full readout." = "自检发现 %@ 个监听者在应答：\n%@\n完整的读数在 EMCON 的自我侦察里。";
"The self-scan found %@ listeners answering:\n%@\nEMCON's self-recon holds the full readout." = "自检发现 %@ 个监听者在应答：\n%@\n完整的读数在 EMCON 的自我侦察里。";
"The self-scan found nothing answering. On the wire, this phone is a closed door." = "自检没有发现任何应答。在线上，这部手机是一扇关着的门。";
"The self-scan is EMCON's organ and it hasn't reached me yet — open the EMCON tab once and ask again." = "自检是 EMCON 的器官，它还没到我这儿——先打开一次 EMCON 标签页，再问我。";
